hadiths[289]{hadithnumber,text}:
"752","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Ka'b Qurazi ya ghair se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Adam (Alaihissalam) ne hajj kiya to farishton se mulaqat hui aur unhon ne kaha: Aey Adam! Tumhara nusuk mubarak ho, ham ne tum se do hazaar saal pahle hajj kiya tha."
"753","[AI-translation] Abu Salih Hanafi se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Hajj jihad hai aur Umrah nafl hai.'"
"754","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Abbad bin Ja'far se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Abdullah bin Umar ke paas baithe aur main ne unhen kahte suna: Ek aadmi ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha aur kaha: Hajji kya hai? To Aap ne farmaya: 'Paragandah haal ghubar alood.' Phir doosra khada hua aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Rasta kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: 'Tosha aur sawari.'"
"755","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abi Aufa Sahabi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne un se us aadmi ke bare mein poocha jis ne hajj nahin kiya, kya woh hajj ke liye qarz le? Unhon ne kaha: 'Nahin.'"
"756","[AI-translation] Ibn Juraij se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nafi' se kaha: Kya tum ne Abdullah bin Umar ko hajj ke maheenon ke naam lete suna hai? To unhon ne kaha: Han, woh Shawwal, Zulqa'dah aur Zulhijjah ke naam lete. Main ne Nafi' se kaha: Phir agar koi in se pahle hajj ka ehram bandhe? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne un se is ke bare mein kuch nahin suna."
"757","[AI-translation] Abu Zubair se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Jabir bin Abdullah se poochte suna us aadmi ke bare mein ke kya woh hajj ke maheenon se pahle hajj ka ehram bandhe? To unhon ne kaha: Nahin."
"758","[AI-translation] Ata se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne jab mawaaqeet muqarrar farmain to farmaya: 'Aadmi apne ghar walon aur apne kapdon se faida uthae yahan tak ke mawaaqeet ke liye falan aur falan aae.'"
"759","[AI-translation] Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Madinah ka ek aadmi Madinah mein masjid mein khada hua aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Aap hamen kahan se ehram bandhne ka hukm dete hain? Aap ne farmaya: 'Madinah wale Zulhulaifah se ehram bandhen, Sham wale Juhfah se ehram bandhen, aur Najd wale Qarn se ehram bandhen.' Nafi' ne mujh se kaha: Aur woh samajhte hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Yaman wale Yalamlam se ehram bandhen.'"
"760","[AI-translation] Salim bin Abdullah se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Madinah wale Zulhulaifah se ehram bandhen, Sham wale Juhfah se ehram bandhen, aur Najd wale Qarn se ehram bandhen.' Ibn Umar ne kaha: Aur woh samajhte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Yaman wale Yalamlam se ehram bandhen.'"
"761","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Dinar se, Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Madinah walon ko hukm diya gaya ke woh Zulhulaifah se ehram bandhen, Sham wale Juhfah se aur Najd wale Qarn se ehram bandhen. Ibn Umar ne kaha: Yeh teen main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se sune. Aur mujhe bataya gaya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Yaman wale Yalamlam se ehram bandhen.'"
"762","[AI-translation] Ibn Tawus se, apne walid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Madinah walon ke liye Hulaifah, Sham walon ke liye Juhfah, Najd walon ke liye Qarn, aur Yaman walon ke liye Yalamlam muqarrar farmaya. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Yeh mawaaqeet in walon ke liye hain aur har us ke liye jo in par se guzre jo in walon mein se na ho jo hajj ya umrah ka irada rakhta ho. Aur jo is meeqat se neeche ho to woh wahan se ehram bandhe jahan se woh chale yahan tak ke yeh Makkah walon par hai.'"
"763","[AI-translation] Ibn Tawus se, apne walid se, Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se mawaaqeet ke bare mein Sufyan ki mawaaqeet wali hadees ke ma'na ki misl riwayat hai."
"764","[AI-translation] Thawus se, Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Madinah walon ke liye Zulhulaifah, Sham walon ke liye Juhfah, Yaman walon ke liye Yalamlam, Najd walon ke liye Qarn muqarrar farmaya. Aur jo is se neeche ho to wahan se jahan se woh chale."
"765","[AI-translation] Abu Zubair se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Jabir bin Abdullah se muhil ke bare mein poochte suna. To unhon ne kaha: Main ne use suna phir woh ruke, mera khayal hai woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki taraf ishara karte, farmaya: 'Madinah wale Zulhulaifah se ehram bandhen, doosra rasta Juhfah se aur Maghrib wale, Iraq wale Zatu Irq se ehram bandhen, Najd wale Qarn se, aur Yaman wale Yalamlam se ehram bandhen.'"
"766","[AI-translation] Ata se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Madinah walon ke liye Zulhulaifah, Maghrib walon ke liye Juhfah, Mashriq walon ke liye Zatu Irq, Najd walon ke liye Qarn muqarrar farmaya. Aur jo Najd se guzre Yaman walon aur in ke siwa mein se Qarn Zil Ma'adin, aur Yaman walon ke liye Yalamlam."
"767","[AI-translation] Ibn Juraij se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ata se dobara poocha aur kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne, woh samajhte hain, Zatu Irq muqarrar nahin farmaya aur us waqt Mashriq wale na the. Unhon ne kaha: Us din Iraq na tha, lekin us waqt Mashriq walon ke liye. Unhon ne kaha: Ham ne isi tarah suna: Beshak us ne Mashriq walon ke liye Zatu Irq ya Aqeeq muqarrar farmaya. Unhon ne kaha: Us din Iraq na tha, lekin Mashriq walon ke liye. Aur us ne use Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke siwa Sahaba mein se kisi ki taraf mansoob nahin kiya, lekin woh inkar karta hai siwae is ke ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use muqarrar farmaya."
"768","[AI-translation] Ibn Tawus se, apne walid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Zatu Irq muqarrar nahin farmaya, aur us waqt Mashriq wale na the. To logon ne Zatu Irq muqarrar kiya. Shafi'i ne farmaya: Main use Thawus ke qaul jaisa hi samajhta hun. Wallahu a'lam."
"769","[AI-translation] Abu Sha'sa se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Mashriq walon ke liye kuch muqarrar nahin farmaya. To logon ne Qarn ke muqabil Zatu Irq apna liya."
"770","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai aur unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke hajj aur Aap ke unhen halal hone ke hukm ka zikr kiya. Beshak Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum Mina ki taraf shaam ko jao to ehram bandho.'"
"771","[AI-translation] Abu Sha'sa se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Ibn Abbas ko dekha jo mawaaqeet se baghair ehram ke guzarne wale ko wapas karte."
"772","[AI-translation] Abdul Aziz bin Abdullah bin Khalid se, Muharrish Ka'bi se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Ji'ranah se raat mein nikle aur umrah kiya aur subah wahan is tarah ki jaise raat guzari ho."
"773","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se yeh hadees riwayat hai. Ibn Juraij ne kaha: Woh Mikhrash hai. Shafi'i ne farmaya: Ibn Juraij ne durust kaha, kyunke is ka beta hamare paas Mikhrash hai."
"774","[AI-translation] Amr bin Dinar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Amr bin Aus ko kahte suna: Mujhe Abdur Rahman bin Abi Bakr ne khabar di: Beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen hukm diya ke woh Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ko sawari par peeche bithae aur unhen Tan'im se umrah karae."
"775","[AI-translation] Ibn Musayyab se riwayat hai ke Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne ek saal mein do martaba umrah kiya: Ek martaba Zulhulaifah se, aur ek martaba Juhfah se."
"776","[AI-translation] Qasim bin Muhammad se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki biwi Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne ek saal mein do martaba umrah kiya. Sadaqah bin Yasar ne kaha: To main ne kaha: Kya kisi ne is par unhen malamat ki? Unhon ne kaha: SubhanAllah! Ummul Momineen. To mujhe sharm aai."
"777","[AI-translation] Musa bin Uqbah se, Nafi' se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Umar Ibn Zubair ke zamane mein kai saal har saal do umrah karte."
"778","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik ki aulad mein se baaz se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Anas bin Malik ke sath Makkah mein the. Jab un ke sar mein dard hota to woh nikalte aur umrah karte."
"779","[AI-translation] Mujahid se riwayat hai ke Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Har maheene mein umrah hai."
"780","[AI-translation] Mujahid se riwayat hai ke Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Har maheene mein umrah hai."
"781","[AI-translation] Qasim bin Muhammad se riwayat hai ke Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne ek saal mein do martaba, ya unhon ne kaha: Kai martaba umrah kiya. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Kya kisi ne is par unhen malamat ki? To Qasim ne kaha: Ummul Momineen. To mujhe sharm aai."
"782","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke unhon ne ek saal mein do martaba, ya unhon ne kaha: Kai martaba umrah kiya."
"783","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Baitul Maqdis se ehram bandha."
"784","[AI-translation] Ibn Aus Saqafi se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdur Rahman bin Abi Bakr ko kahte suna: Mujhe Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hukm diya ke main Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ko umrah karaun. To main ne unhen Tan'im se umrah karaya. Unhon ne ya ghair ne hadees mein kaha: Hasbah ki raat."
"785","[AI-translation] Ja'far bin Muhammad se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke Ali Jumah ke din, Eidain ke din, Arafah ke din, aur jab ehram bandhne ka irada karte to ghusl karte."
"786","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Qasim se, apne walid se, Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Aap ke ehram ke liye is se pahle ke Aap ehram bandhen khushbu lagati, aur Aap ke halal hone ke liye Baitullah ke tawaf se pahle khushbu lagati."
"787","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Qasim se, apne walid se, Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, aur unhon ne apne donon hath phailae kahte: Main ne apne in donon hathon se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Aap ke ehram ke liye jab Aap ne ehram bandha khushbu lagai, aur Aap ke halal hone ke liye Baitullah ke tawaf se pahle khushbu lagai."
"788","[AI-translation] Urwah se, Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne apne in donon hathon se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Aap ke hurmat ke liye jab Aap ne ehram bandha khushbu lagai, aur Aap ke halal hone ke liye Baitullah ke tawaf se pahle khushbu lagai."
"789","[AI-translation] Usman bin Urwah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne apne walid ko kahte suna: Main ne Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ko kahte suna: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Aap ke hurmat aur Aap ke halal hone ke liye khushbu lagai. To main ne un se kaha: Kis khushbu se? To unhon ne kaha: Sab se umdah khushbu se. Usman ne kaha: Hisham ne yeh hadees mere siwa kisi se riwayat nahin ki."
"790","[AI-translation] Ata bin Sa'ib se, Ibrahim se, Aswad se, Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sar ki mang mein teen din ke baad khushbu ki chamak dekhi."
"791","[AI-translation] Hasan bin Zaid se, apne walid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) ko ehram ki haalat mein dekha jabke in ke sar par ghaliyah ki tarah tha."
"792","[AI-translation] Aishah bint Sa'd se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne apne walid ko ehram ke waqt mushk aur zarirah khushbu lagai."
"793","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Hajj Ifrad kiya."
"794","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sirf hajj ka ehram bandha."
"795","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Hajj Ifrad kiya."
"796","[AI-translation] Aswad se, Abdullah yani Abdullah bin Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Hajj Ifrad ka fatwa diya. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Woh donon mein se har ek ko paragandah haal aur safar par tarjeeh dete hain, in ki rae hai ke Hajj Qiran afzal hai. Jab koi in se fatwa mange to woh wahi fatwa dete hain, jabke Abdullah khud Hajj Qiran ko napasand karte."
"797","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath hajj ke liye nikle. Yahan tak ke jab Sarif ya is ke qareeb pahunche to mujhe haiz aaya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aae jabke main ro rahi thi. Aap ne farmaya: 'Tumhen kya hua, kya tumhen haiz aaya hai?' Main ne kaha: Han. Aap ne farmaya: 'Yeh woh cheez hai jo Allah ne Adam ki betiyon par muqarrar ki hai. Baitullah ke tawaf ke siwa hajj ke tamam manasik ada karo.' Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne farmaya: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apni biwiyon ki taraf se gae ki qurbani ki."
"798","[AI-translation] Ja'far bin Muhammad se, apne walid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Jabir ne bayan kiya: Beshak Ali jab sadqat jama karke farigh hue aur aae to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se poocha: 'Aey Ali! Tum ne kis ke liye ehram bandha hai?' Unhon ne kaha: Us ke liye jis ke liye Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ehram bandha hai. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Qurbani karo aur ehram mein raho.'"
"799","[AI-translation] Ja'far bin Muhammad se, apne walid se, Jabir se riwayat hai aur woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke hajj ke bare mein bayan karte hain. Unhon ne kaha: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath nikle yahan tak ke jab Baida mein pahunche to main ne apni nigaah ki had tak Aap ke aage, daen, baen aur peeche sawar aur paidal dekhe, sab Aap ki pairwi karna chahte. Woh koshish karte ke wohi kahen jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) kahte. Ham ne hajj ke siwa kisi ki niyat na ki, aur is ke siwa kuch na jante, aur umrah ko na jante. Jab ham ne tawaf kiya aur Marwah par the to Aap ne farmaya: 'Aey logon! Jis ke paas hadi na ho woh halal ho jae, aur use umrah bana le. Agar mujhe pahle maloom hota jo baad mein maloom hua to main hadi na lata.' To jo hadi na rakhte the woh halal ho gae."
"800","[AI-translation] Asma bint Abi Bakr (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath nikle. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jis ke paas hadi na ho woh halal ho jae.' Aur mere paas hadi na thi to main halal ho gai, jabke Zubair ke paas hadi thi to woh halal na hue."
"801","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Zulqa'dah ke paanch din baqi the jab ham Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath hajj ke liye nikle. Jab Sarif ya is ke qareeb pahunche to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hukm diya ke jo hadi na rakhte hon woh apne ehram ko umrah bana len. Aur jab ham Mina mein the to mere paas gae ka gosht laya gaya. Main ne poocha: Yeh kaisa gosht hai? Kaha gaya: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apni biwiyon ki taraf se qurbani ki hai. Yahya ne kaha: Main ne yeh hadees Qasim bin Muhammad ko bayan ki. To unhon ne kaha: Umrah! Allah ki qasam! Tum hadees ko is ki asal par lae ho."
"802","[AI-translation] Umrah aur Qasim se Sufyan ki sanad se baghair ma'na ke ikhtilaf ke isi tarah riwayat hai."
"803","[AI-translation] Ibn Tawus, Ibrahim bin Maisarah aur Hisham bin Hujairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne Tawus ko kahte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Madinah se nikle baghair hajj ya umrah ka naam liye, faisle ke intezar mein. To Aap par faisla nazil hua jabke Aap Safa aur Marwah ke darmiyan the. To Aap ne apne Sahaba ko hukm diya jo ehram bandhe hue the aur in ke paas hadi na thi ke use umrah bana len. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Agar mujhe pahle maloom hota jo baad mein maloom hua to main hadi na lata. Lekin main ne apne sar ko jama diya hai, aur apni hadi laaya hun, aur meri hadi ki jagah se pahle mere liye halal hona nahin.' To Suraqah bin Malik Aap ki taraf khade hue aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Hamare liye aisa faisla karen jaise ham aaj paida hue hon. Kya hamari yeh umrah is saal ke liye hai ya hamesha ke liye? Aap ne farmaya: 'Balke hamesha ke liye.' Umrah hajj mein dakhil ho gaya qayamat ke din tak. Unhon ne kaha: Ali Yaman se aae (Raziyallahu anhu). To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: 'Tum ne kis ke sath ehram bandha hai?' To un mein se ek ne Tawus se kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke ehram ke sath. Doosre ne kaha: Labbaik Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke hajj ke sath."
"804","[AI-translation] Ja'far bin Muhammad se, apne walid se, Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Madinah mein nau saal rahe aur hajj na kiya. Phir daswen saal mein unhon ne logon mein hajj ka elaan kiya. Log Aap ke sath nikalne ke liye Madinah aane lage. To woh nikle aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) rawana hue aur ham bhi Aap ke sath rawana hue. Ham sirf hajj jante aur isi ke liye nikle. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamare darmiyan the, Aap par Quran nazil hota tha, aur woh is ki taweel jante, aur wohi karte jis ka unhen hukm diya jata. To ham Makkah pahunche. Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Baitullah aur Safa Marwah ka tawaf kiya to Aap ne farmaya: 'Jis ke paas hadi na ho woh use umrah bana le, aur agar mujhe pahle maloom hota jo baad mein maloom hua to main hadi na lata aur use umrah bana leta.'"
"805","[AI-translation] Tawus se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hajj ya umrah ka naam liye baghair nikle, faisle ke intezar mein. Tawus ne kaha ke jab Aap Safa aur Marwah ke darmiyan tawaf kar rahe the to Aap par faisla nazil hua. To Aap ne apne Sahaba (Raziyallahu anhum) ko hukm diya ke jo in mein se hajj ka ehram bandhe hue hon aur in ke paas hadi na ho to use umrah bana len. Phir Aap ne farmaya: 'Agar mujhe pahle maloom hota jo baad mein maloom hua to main hadi na lata, lekin main apne irade par jam gaya hun aur apni hadi laaya hun, to mere liye apni qurbani diye baghair halal hona jaiz nahin.' Phir Suraqah bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki taraf khade hue aur kaha: 'Ya Rasulullah! Hamare bare mein aisa faisla karen jaise ham aaj paida hone wali nai qaum hon? Kya hajj ko umrah banane ka yeh amal sirf is saal ke liye hai ya hamesha ke liye?' To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Balke hamesha ke liye. Umrah hajj mein dakhil ho gaya qayamat ke din tak.' Unhon ne kaha: Phir Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) Yaman se dakhil hue. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se poocha, yani: 'Tum ne kis ke sath ehram bandha hai?' To un mein se ek ne kaha: Labbaik Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke ehram jaisa ehram. Doosre ne kaha: Labbaik Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke hajj jaisa hajj."
"806","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) Hazrat Hafsa (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat karte hain ke unhon ne kaha: 'Ya Rasulullah! Logon ko kya hai ke woh umrah se halal ho gae jabke Aap apne umrah se halal na hue?' To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Main ne apne baal jama diye hain aur apni hadi ko haar pahnaya hai. To main zibah kiye baghair halal nahin hounga.'"
"807","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Abdullah bin Haris bin Naufal se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas aur Dahhak bin Qais (Raziyallahu anhuma) ko us saal Hajj Tamattu' par guftagu karte suna jab Mu'awiyah bin Abi Sufyan (Raziyallahu anhu) hajj ke liye aae. Dahhak ne kaha: 'Hajj Tamattu' sirf woh karega jo Allah ka hukm nahin janta.' Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: 'Aey bhatije! Tum ne achhi baat nahin kahi.' Dahhak ne kaha: 'Umar ne is se mana farmaya tha.' To Sa'd ne kaha: 'Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Hajj Tamattu' kiya aur ham ne bhi Aap ke sath Hajj Tamattu' kiya.'"
"808","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Hajj se pahle Umrah aur qurbani karna mujhe hajj ke baad Zulhijjah ke maheene mein umrah karne se zyada pasand hai."
"809","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai ke un se poocha gaya: Umrah ko hajj se pahle karne ke bare mein tumhara kya khayal hai, jabke Allah Azza wa Jalla farmata hai? To Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Tum kaise padhte ho: Wasiyat se pahle qarz ki adaaigi, ya qarz ki adaaigi se pahle wasiyat? Unhon ne kaha: Wasiyat qarz ki adaaigi se pahle. Unhon ne kaha: Tum donon mein se kis se aaghaz karoge? Unhon ne kaha: Qarz se. Unhon ne kaha: To yahi hai. Shafi'i ne farmaya: Yani hajj se pahle umrah karna jaiz hai."
"810","[AI-translation] Nafi' se riwayat hai ke Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne fitne ke saal mein hajj ka irada kiya. Unhon ne ehram bandha phir ghaur kiya aur kaha: Hajj aur Umrah donon ek hain. Main tumhen gawah banata hun ke main ne hajj ke sath umrah wajib kar liya hai."
"811","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath hajjatul wada' ke saal mein nikle. Ham mein se baaz ne hajj ka ehram bandha, ham mein se baaz ne umrah ka ehram bandha, aur ham mein se baaz ne hajj aur umrah ko jama kiya. Aur main un mein se thi jinhon ne umrah ka ehram bandha."
"812","[AI-translation] Urwah se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Dubaa'ah bint Zubair ke paas se guzre aur farmaya: 'Kya tum hajj ka irada nahin rakhti?' Us ne kaha: Mujhe beemari ki wajah se shubah hai. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: 'Hajj ka ehram bandho aur shart lagao ke main wahan halal houngi jahan mujhe roka gaya.'"
"813","[AI-translation] Urwah se riwayat hai ke Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne mujh se kaha: 'Jab tum hajj karo to kya tum istisna karte ho?' Urwah ne kaha: Main ne poocha: Main kya kahun? Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne farmaya: Kaho: Aey Allah! Main ne hajj ki niyat ki hai aur is ke liye rawana hua hun. Agar Tu mere liye aasan kare to yeh hajj hai, aur agar koi rukawat mujhe roke to yeh umrah hai.'"
"814","[AI-translation] Nafi' se riwayat hai ke woh Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se bayan karte hain ke fitne ke zamane mein woh Makkah ki taraf umrah ke liye nikle aur kaha: Agar mujhe Baitullah se roka gaya to ham waisa karenge jaisa ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath kiya. Shafi'i ne farmaya: Yani ham isi tarah halal honge jaise ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Hudaibiyah wale saal mein halal hue."
"815","[AI-translation] Urwah se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Dubaa'ah ko wasiyat ki aur farmaya: 'Kya tum hajj ka irada nahin rakhti?' Us ne kaha: Mujhe beemari ki wajah se shubah hai. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Hajj ka ehram bandho aur shart lagao ke main wahan halal houngi jahan mujhe meri beemari ki wajah se roka gaya.'"
"816","[AI-translation] Urwah se riwayat hai ke Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne mujh se kaha: Aey bhatije! Jab tum hajj ka irada karo to kya tum bhi istisna karte ho? Main ne kaha: Main kya kahun? Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne farmaya: 'Kaho: Aey Allah! Main ne hajj ki niyat ki hai aur is ke liye rawana hua hun. Agar Tu mere liye aasan kare to yeh hajj hai, aur agar koi rukawat mujhe roke to yeh umrah hai.'"
"817","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apni talbiyah mein hajj ya umrah ka naam na lete."
"818","[AI-translation] Salim se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki talbiyah thi: Aey Allah! Main hazir hun, main hazir hun, Tera koi shareek nahin, main hazir hun. Beshak hamd, nemat aur badshahat Tere liye hai, Tera koi shareek nahin. Nafi' ne kaha ke Abdullah bin Umar is par izafa karte: Main hazir hun, main hazir hun, aur main Teri bandagi karta hun, aur bhalai Tere hath mein hai. Khwahish aur amal Teri taraf hain."
"819","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne tauheed ke sath talbiyah kahi: 'Main hazir hun, Aey Allah! Main hazir hun. Main hazir hun, Tera koi shareek nahin, main hazir hun. Beshak hamd aur nemat Tere liye hai aur badshahat sirf Tere liye hai, Tera koi shareek nahin.'"
"820","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki talbiyah ke kalimon mein se bhi tha: 'Main hazir hun, Aey barhaq Ma'bud! Main hazir hun.'"
"821","[AI-translation] Mujahid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) is tarah talbiyah kahte: 'Main hazir hun, Aey Allah! Main hazir hun, main hazir hun, Tera koi shareek nahin. Main hazir hun, beshak hamd aur nemat Tere liye hai aur badshahat Teri hai, Tera koi shareek nahin.' Woh isi tarah kahte yahan tak ke ek din jab log wapas hue to goya yeh kalime unhen achhe lage. To Aap ne is par yeh kalime badhae: 'Main hazir hun, haqeeqi zindagi aakhirat ki zindagi hai.' Ibn Juraij ne kaha: Mere khayal mein yeh Arafah ka din tha."
"822","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abi Salamah se riwayat hai ke Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas ne apne ek bhatije ko talbiyah kahte suna aur woh kah raha tha: 'Aey seedhiyon wale!' To Sa'd ne kaha: 'Kaisi seedhiyan? Beshak Woh seedhiyon wala hai, magar Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein ham is tarah talbiyah na kahte.'"
"823","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Abu Bakr Saqafi se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se poocha jabke woh donon subah Mina se Arafat ja rahe the: Tum log Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath is din kya karte the? Anas ne kaha: Ham mein se baaz talbiyah kahte aur koi etiraz na karta, aur baaz takbeer kahte aur koi etiraz na karta."
"824","[AI-translation] Sa'ib Ansari se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jibrail (Alaihissalam) mere paas aae aur mujhe hukm diya ke main apne Sahaba ya jo mere sath hain unhen hukm dun ke takbeer ya talbiyah kahte waqt awaz buland karen, woh in donon mein se ek ka irada karte hain.'"
"825","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Munkadir se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) kasrat se talbiyah kahte."
"826","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke woh sawari par, paidal, aur lete hue talbiyah kahte."
"827","[AI-translation] Khuzaimah bin Sabit (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karte hain ke jab Aap talbiyah se farigh hote to Allah Azza wa Jalla se is ki raza aur Jannat mangte, aur is ki rahmat ke zariye Jahannam se panah mangte."
"828","[AI-translation] Fazl bin Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne mujhe khabar di ke Muzdalifah se wapsi par Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen apne peeche sawari par bithaya yahan tak ke Mina. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jamrah par kankariyan marne tak talbiyah kahte rahe."
"829","[AI-translation] Fazl bin Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen Muzdalifah se Mina tak apne peeche sawari par bithaya, aur woh jamrah par kankariyan marne tak talbiyah kahte rahe."
"830","[AI-translation] Fazl bin Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se ek doosri sanad se isi ki misl riwayat hai."
"831","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: 'Umrah karne wala tawaf shuru karne tak talbiyah kahe, chahe use paidal shuru kare ya baghair chale.'"
"832","[AI-translation] Mujahid se, Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se umrah karne wale ke bare mein riwayat hai ke woh Hajar Aswad ko bosa dene tak talbiyah kahe."
"833","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: 'Umrah karne wala tawaf shuru karne tak talbiyah kahe, chahe chhoo kar ya baghair chhue.'"
"834","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne umrah mein Ka'bah ka tawaf karne ke baad Safa par talbiyah kahi."
"835","[AI-translation] Nafi' se, Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: 'Jo hadi se aasan ho' se muraad oont ya gae ki qurbani hai."
"836","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kohan ke daen janib ish'ar kiya."
"837","[AI-translation] Nafi' se, Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke woh is mein koi harj nahin samajhte the ke daen janib ish'ar kiya jae ya baen janib."
"838","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha: 'Ehram wala kaunse kapde pahne?' To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Ehram wala qamees, shalwar, amame, topiyan, aur moze na pahne. Aur jo jootiyan na pae to woh mozon ko takhnon se neeche kaat kar pahne.'"
"839","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap se poocha: 'Muhrim kaunse kapde pahne?' To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: 'Muhrim qamees, amama, topi, shalwar, aur moze na pahne. Magar jo jootiyan na pae woh mozon ko takhnon se neeche kaat kar pahne.'"
"840","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne muhrim ko za'fran ya wars se range kapde pahanne se mana farmaya. Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo jootiyan na pae woh chamde ke moze takhnon se neeche kaat kar pahne.'"
"841","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko khutba dete hue farmate suna: 'Jab ehram wale ke paas jootiyan na hon to woh moze pahne, aur jab woh tehband na pae to woh shalwar pahne.'"
"842","[AI-translation] Ibn Juraij se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek aadmi ko dekha jis ne apna ehram rangeen rassi se bandha tha. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne do martaba farmaya: 'Rassi utar do, rassi utar do.'"
"843","[AI-translation] Muslim bin Jundab se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi aaya aur Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se poochne laga jabke main in donon ke sath tha. Us aadmi ne kaha: Ehram ki haalat mein kya main apni chadar ke donon kinare peeche mukhalif samton mein le ja kar in par girah laga sakta hun? Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne farmaya: Tum bilkul girah na lagao."
"844","[AI-translation] Nafi' ne bayan kiya ke Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) apne pahne hue kapde mein girah na lagate, balke is ke donon kinare modte aur unhen apne tehband mein dabaa lete."
"845","[AI-translation] Thawus se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ko Baitullah ka tawaf karte dekha jabke unhon ne ek kapde se kamar par ehram bandha tha."
"846","[AI-translation] Abu Ja'far se riwayat hai ke Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Abdullah bin Ja'far ko ehram ki haalat mein do range kapde pahne dekha. To unhon ne poocha: Yeh kaunse kapde hain? Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Main zaroori nahin samajhta ke koi hamen sunnat sikhlae. To Umar khamosh ho gae."
"847","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne aadmi ko za'fran lagane se mana farmaya."
"848","[AI-translation] Nafi' se, Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke woh ehram wale ke liye kamarband bandhna makrooh samajhte."
"849","[AI-translation] Ya'la bin Umayyah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Ji'ranah mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath the jab ek aadmi Aap ke paas aaya jo jubba pahne hue tha aur khaluq khushbu lagae hue tha. Us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Main ne umrah ka ehram bandha hai aur main yeh pahne hue hun. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se poocha: Tum apne hajj mein is ke bare mein kya karoge? Us aadmi ne kaha: Main yeh jubba utar dunga aur khaluq dho dunga. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne umrah mein waisa karo jaisa tum apne hajj mein karte ho."
"850","[AI-translation] Ya'la bin Umayyah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke ek dehati Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur woh qamees ya jubba pahne hue tha aur us par zard rang ke nishan the. Us ne kaha: 'Main ne ehram bandha hai aur main yeh pahne hue hun.' Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Apni qamees ya apna jubba utar do aur yeh zard rang apne aap se door karo, aur apne umrah mein waisa karo jaisa tum apne hajj mein karte ho.'"
"851","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karte hain, Aap ne farmaya: 'Us aurat ke liye jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhti ho ek din raat ka safar mahram ke baghair halal nahin.'"
"852","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko khutba dete hue farmate suna: 'Koi mard kisi aurat se tanhai na kare aur aurat ke liye mahram ke baghair safar karna halal nahin.' Ek aadmi khada hua aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mera naam falan jang ke liye likha gaya hai jabke meri biwi hajj ke liye gai hai? Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jao aur apni biwi ke sath hajj karo.'"
"853","[AI-translation] Ja'far bin Muhammad se, apne walid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hamen Jabir ne hadees bayan ki: Beshak jab Zulhulaifah pahunche to Asma bint Umais (Raziyallahu anha) ne bachche ko janam diya. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen ghusl karke ehram bandhne ka hukm diya."
"854","[AI-translation] Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: 'Aurat khushbu lagi kapde na pahne, aur woh zard range kapde pahan sakti hai, kyunke meri rae mein zard rang mein khushbu nahin hoti.'"
"855","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: 'Aurat badi chadar odhe aur is tarah na kare.' Ata ne kaha: Main ne poocha: Woh kya na kare? To unhon ne meri taraf ishara kiya jaise aurat dupatta leti hai. Phir unhon ne rukhsar par dupatte ki taraf ishara kiya aur kaha: 'Woh is se apna chehra na dhanpe. Aur izafi chadar is ke chehre par is tarah latki rahe jaise qudrati latakti hai. Woh use na palte, na pahne, na jode.'"
"856","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke woh aurton ko fatwa dete ke woh ehram mein moze kaat len. Yahan tak ke Safiyah ne unhen Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ke hawale se khabar di ke woh aurton ko fatwa deti thin ke woh moze na katen. Is ke baad Ibn Umar ne apna fatwa chhod diya."
"857","[AI-translation] Safiyah bint Shaibah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ke paas thi jab Banu Abduddar ki aurton mein se Tamlik naam ki ek aurat aai. Us ne kaha: Aey Ummul Momineen! Meri beti ne nazr mani hai ke woh hajj ke mausam mein apna zewar nahin pahnegi. To Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne farmaya: Us se kaho ke Ummul Momineen use qasam de kar kahti hain ke woh apna tamam zewar pahne."
"858","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Aamir bin Rabi'ah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ka sathi raha, aur main ne unhen hajj mein khaima lagate nahin dekha yahan tak ke woh wapas aae."
"859","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abi Bakr se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke Sahaba umratul qaza mein talwaren latkae hue aae jabke woh ehram mein the."
"860","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Hunain se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke Abdullah bin Abbas aur Miswar bin Makhramah (Raziyallahu anhum) ka Abwa ke maqam par ikhtilaf hua. Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: 'Ehram wala apna sar dho sakta hai,' jabke Miswar ne kaha: 'Ehram wala apna sar nahin dho sakta.' To Abdullah bin Abbas ne mujhe Abu Ayyub (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas bheja. Jab main pahuncha to woh kunwen ki lakdiyon ke darmiyan ghusl kar rahe the, kapde se parda kiye hue. Jab main pahuncha aur salam kiya to unhon ne poocha: 'Kaun ho?' Main ne kaha: 'Main Abdullah hun, aur Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) ne mujhe tumhare paas bheja hai taake poochun ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ehram ki haalat mein apna mubarak sar kaise dhote the?' Yeh sunkar unhon ne apna hath us kapde par rakha jis se unhon ne parda kiya tha aur use neeche kiya yahan tak ke main un ka sar dekh saka. Phir unhon ne pani dalne wale se kaha: 'Dalo.' To us ne in ke sar par pani dala phir unhon ne apne donon hathon se apna sar harkat di, aage aur peeche. Phir unhon ne kaha: 'Main ne Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko isi tarah karte dekha.'"
"861","[AI-translation] Ya'la bin Umayyah se riwayat hai ke Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) oont ke peeche ghusl kar rahe the aur main kapda pakde in ke liye parda kiye hue tha. Jab Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: 'Aey Ya'la! Mere sar par pani dalo.' To main ne kaha: 'Ameerul Momineen behtar jante hain.' Phir Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: 'Allah ki qasam! Pani sar ke baalon ko aur uljha deta hai.' Phir unhon ne Allah ka naam liya aur apne sar par pani dala."
"862","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Kabhi Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) kahte: 'Aao! Main tumhen pani mein dubota hun taake ham dekhen kis ki sans zyada der tak rukti hai,' jabke ham ehram mein the."
"863","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai ke woh Juhfah ke maqam par hammam mein dakhil hue jabke ehram mein the aur kaha: 'Beshak Allah Azza wa Jalla hamare mail kuchail ki kuch parwah nahin karta.'"
"864","[AI-translation] Nafi' se, Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke jab unhen ehram ki haalat mein aankh ka dard hota to woh apni aankhon mein elwa tapkate. Aur kehte: 'Ehram wala aankh ke dard ke liye har qism ka surma laga sakta hai siwae khushbudar surme ke. Woh aankh ke dard ke baghair bhi jaiz nahin.'"
"865","[AI-translation] Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke un se poocha gaya: 'Kya ehram wala tulsi, tail, aur khushbu soongh sakta hai?' To unhon ne kaha: 'Nahin.'"
"866","[AI-translation] Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Ehram wala na nikah kare aur na nikah karae.'"
"867","[AI-translation] Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Ehram wala na nikah kare, na nikah karae, aur na paigham bheje.'"
"868","[AI-translation] Nabih bin Wahb se riwayat hai ke Umar bin Ubaidullah ne Talhah bin Umar ka nikah Shaibah bin Jubair ki beti se karne ka irada kiya. To unhon ne Aban bin Usman ko shirkat ke liye paigham bheja, jabke woh donon ehram mein the. Aban ne shirkat se inkar kar diya aur kaha: Main ne Usman bin Affan (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kahte suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Ehram wala na nikah kare, na nikah karae, na paigham bheje.'"
"869","[AI-translation] Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se ek doosri sanad se pichhli hadees ke ma'na ki misl riwayat hai."
"870","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: 'Ehram wala na nikah kare, na doosre ka nikah karae, na paigham bheje, aur na doosre ke liye paigham bheje.'"
"871","[AI-translation] Abu Ghathfan bin Tharif Marri se riwayat hai ke unhon ne khabar di ke in ke walid Tharif ne ehram ki haalat mein ek aurat se nikah kiya. To Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne in donon ke nikah ko mansookh kar diya."
"872","[AI-translation] Sulaiman bin Yasar se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne ghulam Abu Rafi' aur Ansar ke do aadmiyon ko bheja. Phir un donon ne Aap ka Maimunah (Raziyallahu anha) se nikah karaya, jabke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Madinah mein the."
"873","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Musayyab se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: 'Falan ne ghalti ki kyunke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Maimunah se nikah kiya jabke halal the.'"
"874","[AI-translation] Yazeed bin Asam se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Maimunah se nikah kiya jabke halal the."
"875","[AI-translation] Sulaiman bin Yasar se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Abu Rafi' jo Aap ke ghulam the aur Ansar ke ek aadmi ko bheja. Phir un donon ne Aap ka Maimunah bint Haris (Raziyallahu anha) se nikah karaya qabl is ke ke woh Madinah se Makkah ke liye niklen."
"876","[AI-translation] Yazeed bin Asam jo Maimunah (Raziyallahu anha) ke bhanje hain, se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Maimunah se nikah kiya jabke halal the."
"877","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Musayyab se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: 'Woh ghalti par hai jis ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Maimunah se nikah kiya jabke ehram mein the, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se nikah kiya jabke ehram mein na the.'"
"878","[AI-translation] Ibn Juraij se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ata se Allah ke farman ke bare mein poocha: Ehram ki haalat mein shikar na qatl karo. Aur jo tum mein se use jaan boojh kar qatl kare [Ma'idah: 95], kya jo bhool kar qatl kare is par bhi jurmana hai? Ata ne kaha: Han, yeh Allah ki hurmaton ki tazeem ki wajah se hai. Aur isi par amal hota aaya hai."
"879","[AI-translation] Amr bin Dinar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne dekha ke log janwar ke ghalti se qatl mein bhi diyat dete."
"880","[AI-translation] Ibn Juraij ne kaha: Mujahid kahte the ke jo tum mein se shikar kare jaan boojh kar use qatl kare baghair bhoole jabke ehram mein ho, aur is ki is ke siwa koi niyat na ho, to us ne ghalti ki aur woh halal ho gaya. Is ke liye koi rukhsat nahin. Aur jo use is ki hurmat yaad kiye baghair ya is ke siwa koi niyat rakh kar qatl kare to us ne bhi ghalti ki. Yeh ghalat niyat aisi hai ke is ke liye is jaise janwar se kaffara hai."
"881","[AI-translation] Ibn Juraij se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ata se kaha: 'Aur jurmana wajib hai is janwar ke barabar jo us ne qatl kiya jaisa tum mein se do aadil faisla karen, chahe woh jurmana maweshiyon mein se ho, Ka'bah tak hadiya bana kar le jaya jae, ya kaffara ho, mohtajon ko khana khilana [Ma'idah: 95].' Ata ne kaha: Kyunke us ne us janwar ka Haram mein shikar kiya aur woh Baitullah ka bhi irada rakhta hai, to is ka kaffara bhi Baitullah ke paas diya jaega."
"882","[AI-translation] Amr bin Dinar se Allah ke hukm ke bare mein riwayat hai: 'Fidya hai, woh roza rakhe, ya sadqa kare, ya qurbani kare [Baqarah: 196],' ke is mein ikhtiyar hai, woh kare jo chahe."
"883","[AI-translation] Ata se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) ko kahte suna: Dab'u ke liye jurmana mendha hai."
"884","[AI-translation] Ikrimah Maula Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne dab'u ka chhote neze se shikar kiya, aur is ke jurmane mein mendha muqarrar farmaya."
"885","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hiran ke bachche ke shikar ke jurmane mein bakri ka fatwa diya."
"886","[AI-translation] Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne khargosh ke liye ek saala bakri ke bachche ya dumbe ka, aur chuhe ko maarne par chaar maah ke bakri ke bachche ka jurmane mein faisla diya."
"887","[AI-translation] Tariq bin Shihab se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham hajj ke liye nikle aur ham mein se ek jise Arbad kaha jata tha ne hiran ka shikar kiya aur is ki peeth zakhmi kar di. Ham Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas aae aur Arbad ne un se is ke bare mein poocha. Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Aey Arbad! Tum khud faisla karo. Us ne kaha: Aey Ameerul Momineen! Tum mujh se zyada jante aur behtar ho. Umar ne un se kaha: Main tumhen is muamle mein faisla karne ka hukm deta hun, main ne tumhen meri sifaten bayan karne ka hukm nahin diya. To Arbad ne kaha: Meri rae mein is ka jurmana woh bakri hai jo charne ke qabil ho. Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha, tasdeeq karte: Yahi is ka jurmana hai."
"888","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne faisla diya ke jurmane mein: Dab'u ke liye mendha, hiran ke bachche ke liye bakri, khargosh ke liye ek saala bakri ka bacha ya dumba, aur chuhe ke liye chaar maah ka bakri ka bacha diya jae."
"889","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Yarbu' mein chaar maah ke bakri ke bachche dene ka fatwa diya."
"890","[AI-translation] Abu Safar se riwayat hai ke Usman bin Affan (Raziyallahu anhu) ne faisla diya ke dab jaisa janwar maarne ke jurmane mein bakriyon mein se bacha diya jae."
"891","[AI-translation] Ziyad jo Banu Makhzum ke aazad karda the aur siqah the, se riwayat hai: Logon ki ek jama'at ne ehram ki haalat mein shikar kiya. To Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne un se kaha: 'Tum par fidya wajib hai.' Unhon ne poocha: 'Kya ham mein se har ek par alag fidya wajib hai ya ham sab par sirf ek hai?' Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne farmaya: 'Waisa nahin jaisa tumhare darmiyan mashhoor hai, balke tum sab par sirf ek fidya wajib hai.'"
"892","[AI-translation] Abu Musa Ash'ari (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne shutar murgh ke ande ke bare mein kaha: 'Jo ehram ki haalat mein use uthae to is par ek din ke roze ka kaffara hai ya ek miskeen ko khana khilana hai.'"
"893","[AI-translation] Ek doosri sanad se Abdullah bin Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se bhi isi tarah marvi hai."
"894","[AI-translation] Yusuf bin Mahak se riwayat hai ke Abdullah bin Abi Ammar ne unhen khabar di ke woh Mu'az bin Jabal aur Ka'b Ahbar ke sath logon mein Baitul Maqdis se umrah ka ehram bandhe hue aae. Jab ham raste mein the aur Ka'b aag par haath taap rahe the to tiddiyon ka ek jhund guzra. To unhon ne do tiddiyan pakden aur unhen bhun liya aur apna ehram bhool gae. Phir jab unhen apna ehram yaad aaya to unhen phenk diya. Jab ham Madinah aae to woh log Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas dakhil hue, aur main bhi in ke sath dakhil hua. To Ka'b (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ko do tiddiyon ka qissa sunaya. To Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne poocha: 'Woh kaun hai? Shayad tum ho Aey Ka'b?' Unhon ne kaha: 'Han.' Umar ne kaha: 'Himyar tiddi pasand karta hai.' Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: 'Tum ne apne dil mein kya muqarrar kiya?' Unhon ne kaha: 'Do dirham.' Unhon ne kaha: 'Khoob! Do dirham sau tiddiyon se behtar hain. Wohi do jo tum ne apne dil mein muqarrar kiya.'"
"895","[AI-translation] Ata ne kaha: Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Haram mein tiddi ke shikar ke bare mein poocha gaya. To unhon ne kaha: 'Nahin,' aur is se mana farmaya. Ata ne kaha: Main ne un se kaha, ya logon mein se ek aadmi ne un se kaha: 'Tumhari qaum masjid mein kapde bandhe baithe hain aur unhen pakadte hain?' To Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne farmaya: 'Unhen ilm nahin hai.'"
"896","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se ek doosri sanad se isi tarah riwayat hai, siwae is ke ke rawi ne muhtaboon ke bajae munhanun ka lafz zikr kiya, ke woh jhuke hue hain. Aur huffaz ne Ibn Juraij se riwayat kiya ke munhanun muhtaboon se zyada faseeh hai."
"897","[AI-translation] Qasim se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) ke paas baitha tha jab ek aadmi ne un se ehram ki haalat mein tiddi maarne ke hukm ke bare mein poocha. Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne farmaya: 'Is ke liye ek mutthi khana hai aur use zaroor ek mutthi tiddiyan pakadni chahiye.' Shafi'i ne farmaya ke Ibn Abbas ke qaul ke woh ek mutthi tiddiyan pakde ka ma'na hai ke sirf qeemat ka etibar hoga. Aur in ke qaul lau ka ma'na hai ke us qeemat ki adaaigi mein ehtiyat ki jaegi, aur woh is se zyada dega jo is par wajib hai, jab main ne tumhen khabar di ke woh is se zyada hai jo tum par wajib hai."
"898","[AI-translation] Qasim se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se ehram wale ke tiddi ke shikar ke bare mein poocha. Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke woh ek mutthi gehun sadqa kare. Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) ne bhi kaha ke woh ek mutthi tiddiyan pakde, lekin yeh rae hai."
"899","[AI-translation] Nafi' bin Abdul Haris se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) Makkah aae aur Jumah ke din Darun Nadwah mein dakhil hue. Woh wahan se masjid jane ke liye qareeb hona chahte the. To unhon ne apni chadar ghar ke ek sutoon par rakhi. Phir is kabootar mein se ek parinda aaya aur baitha. Unhon ne use uda diya, aur saanp ne is par jhapat kar use maar diya. Jumah ki namaz ke baad main aur Usman bin Affan (Raziyallahu anhuma) in ke paas dakhil hue. To unhon ne kaha: 'Mere bare mein us cheez ka faisla karo jo main ne aaj ki hai. Main is ghar mein dakhil hua aur wahan se masjid jane ke liye qareeb hona chahta tha. To main ne apni chadar is sutoon par rakhi. Phir is kabootar mein se ek parinda aaya aur baitha. Mujhe khadsha hua ke woh use apni beet se ganda kar dega to main ne use uda diya. To woh doosre sutoon par ja baitha phir saanp ne is par jhapat kar use maar diya. Mujhe apne dil mein mehsus hua ke main ne use aman ki jagah se uda kar halakat ki jagah bhej diya. To main ne Usman se kaha: Tumhara kya khayal hai safed do saala bakri ke bare mein jo ham Ameerul Momineen par faisla karen? Unhon ne kaha: Meri rae yahi hai. To Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne is ka hukm diya.'"
"900","[AI-translation] Ata se riwayat hai ke Usman bin Abdullah bin Humaid ke bete ne kabootar maar diya. Woh Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) ke paas aae aur un se is ka zikr kiya. To Ibn Abbas ne farmaya: 'Bakri zibah karo aur sadqa kar do.' Ibn Juraij ne kaha: Main ne Ata se poocha: Kya Makkah ke kabootaron mein se tha? Unhon ne kaha: Han."
"901","[AI-translation] Ata se riwayat hai ke Quraish ke ghulam ne Makkah ke kabootaron mein se ek kabootri maar di. To Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hukm diya ke is ki taraf se bakri jurmane mein di jae."
"902","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Ehram ki haalat mein tumhare liye shikar ka gosht halal hai jab tak tum khud use shikar na karo ya tumhare liye shikar na kiya gaya ho.'"
"903","[AI-translation] Ek doosri sanad se bhi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi tarah marvi hai."
"904","[AI-translation] Ek doosri sanad se Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi tarah marvi hai."
"905","[AI-translation] Shafi'i ne farmaya: Ibn Abi Yahya Darawardi aur Sulaiman bin Abi Yahya se zyada yaad rakhne wala hai."
"906","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se, Sa'b bin Jaththamah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke jab woh Abwa ya Waddan mein the to unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko jangli gadha tohfe mein pesh kiya. Magar Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use wapas kar diya. Phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne in ke chehre par narazgi dekhi to farmaya: 'Agar ham ehram mein na hote to ham use tumhen wapas na karte.'"
"907","[AI-translation] Abu Qatadah Ansari (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Makkah ke raste mein the. Woh apne baaz Sahaba ke sath jo ehram mein the peeche rah gae, jabke woh khud ehram mein na the. Unhon ne jangli gadha dekha aur apne ghode par sawar hue. Phir unhon ne apne Sahaba se jo ehram mein the kaha: 'Mujhe koda do.' Magar unhon ne inkar kar diya. Phir unhon ne apna neza manga, magar unhon ne use bhi dene se inkar kar diya. Aakhir mein unhon ne khud apna neza liya, gadhe par hamla kiya, aur use maar diya. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke baaz Sahaba ne is ka gosht khaya, baaz ne ehram ki wajah se inkar kiya. Jab woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas pahunche to unhon ne Aap se is muamle ke bare mein poocha. Aap ne farmaya: 'Yeh woh khana hai jo Allah ne tumhen diya hai.'"
"908","[AI-translation] Ata bin Yasar se Abu Qatadah (Raziyallahu anhu) ke jangli gadhe ka qissa Abun Nazr ki hadees ki misl marvi hai."
"909","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Aamir bin Rabi'ah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Usman bin Affan (Raziyallahu anhu) ko Arj ke maqam par garmi ke dinon mein ehram ki haalat mein dekha, aur unhon ne apna chehra surkh chadar se dhanpa tha. Phir in ke paas shikar ka gosht laya gaya. To unhon ne apne Sahaba se kaha: 'Khao!' Unhon ne poocha: 'Kya tum nahin khaoge?' Usman ne kaha: 'Main tum jaise nahin hun, kyunke yeh shikar mere liye kiya gaya tha.'"
"910","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Paanch janwar hain jinhen ehram wala maarne mein gunahgar nahin: Kawwa, cheel, bichhu, chuha, aur kaatne wala kutta.'"
"911","[AI-translation] Ibn Abi Ammar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ko Baida ke maqam par ehram ki haalat mein kawwe ko teer se maarte dekha."
"912","[AI-translation] Rabi'ah bin Abdullah bin Hudair se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ko Suqya ke maqam par ehram ki haalat mein apne oont se kilniyan nikal kar mitti mein phenkte dekha."
"913","[AI-translation] Maimun bin Mehran se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Ibn Abbas ke paas tha jab ek aadmi ne un se poocha: 'Main ne joon pakdi aur use phenk diya, phir use talash kiya magar na paya.' Ibn Abbas ne farmaya: 'Yeh gumshuda cheez hai jis ke liye talash ki zaroorat nahin.'"
"914","[AI-translation] Maimun bin Mehran se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) ke paas baitha tha jab ek aadmi aaya aur baith gaya. Main ne is se lambe baalon wala koi aadmi nahin dekha. Us ne kaha: Main ne in baalon ke sath ehram bandha hai. Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Kaanon ke upar baal bandh lo. Us aadmi ne kaha: Main ne apni biwi ke siwa ek aurat ko bosa diya. Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: 'Tumhare munh ne zina kiya.' Us aadmi ne kaha: Main ne joon dekhi aur use phenk diya. Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: 'Yeh aisi gumshuda cheez hai ke is ki talash mein koi faida nahin.'"
"915","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ehram ki haalat mein paseena lagwaya."
"916","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ehram ki haalat mein paseena lagwaya."
"917","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: 'Muhrim paseena na lagwae siwae aisi zaroorat ke jis se bachne ka koi rasta na ho.'"
"918","[AI-translation] Nafi' se riwayat hai ke Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne ehram ki haalat mein aaina dekha."
"919","[AI-translation] Hasan bin Qasim Azraqi se riwayat hai ke Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ehram ki haalat mein apni oontni par sawar the, aur oontni badakne lagi, ek paon aage badhati aur doosra peeche. Rabi' ne kaha: Mere khayal mein Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne yeh ash'aar padhe: Goya is oontni ka sawar un shakhon jaisa hai jo tez hawaon mein jhoole ki tarah jhoolti hain, ya is ka sawar us peene wale jaisa hai jo sharab se madhosh ho. Phir unhon ne kaha: Allahu Akbar! Allahu Akbar!"
"920","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Aswad bin Abd Yaghuth se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Beshak baaz she'r mein hikmat hai.'"
"921","[AI-translation] Hisham bin Urwah se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'She'r kalaam hai, is ki khoobi kalaam ki khoobi jaisi hai, aur is ki kharabi kalaam ki kharabi jaisi hai.'"
"922","[AI-translation] Zaid bin Jubair se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ke sath tha jab un se is ke bare mein poocha gaya. To unhon ne kaha: Yeh Islam ka hajj hai, use apni nazr poori karni chahiye, yani jis par hajj farz ho aur us ne hajj ki nazr mani ho."
"923","[AI-translation] Ata ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek aadmi ko kahte suna: 'Main falan ki taraf se hazir hun.' To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: 'Agar tum pahle hajj kar chuke ho to is ki taraf se talbiyah kaho, warna pahle apne liye hajj karo phir is ki taraf se ada karo.'"
"924","[AI-translation] Ata se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek aadmi ko kahte suna: 'Main falan ki taraf se hazir hun.' To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Agar tum pahle hajj kar chuke ho to is ki taraf se labbaik kaho, warna pahle apne liye hajj karo.'"
"925","[AI-translation] Abu Qilabah se riwayat hai ke Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne ek aadmi ko kahte suna: 'Main Shubrumah ki taraf se hazir hun.' To Ibn Abbas ne farmaya: 'Tum par afsos! Yeh Shubrumah kya hai?' Us aadmi ne Shubrumah se apna rishta bataya. Ibn Abbas ne poocha: 'Kya tum ne apne liye pahle hajj kiya hai?' Us ne kaha: 'Nahin.' Ibn Abbas ne farmaya: 'Pahle apne liye hajj karo, phir Shubrumah ki taraf se hajj karo.'"
"926","[AI-translation] Abu Qilabah se riwayat hai ke Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne ek aadmi ko kahte suna: 'Main Shubrumah ki taraf se hazir hun.' To Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: 'Tum par afsos! Yeh Shubrumah kaun hai?' Ayyub aur Khalid Hazza mein se ek ne kaha ke us aadmi ne kaha: 'Woh mera bhai hai.' Doosre ne kaha ke us ne Shubrumah se apna rishta bataya. Ibn Abbas ne farmaya: 'Kya tum ne apne liye hajj kiya hai?' Us ne kaha: 'Nahin.' Ibn Abbas ne farmaya: 'Pahle apne liye hajj karo, phir Shubrumah ki taraf se hajj karo.'"
"927","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Khats'am qabeela ki ek aurat ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se sawal kiya. Us ne kaha: 'Hajj ka fareeza jo Allah ne apne bandon par farz kiya hai mere budhe walid tak pahuncha hai, jabke woh sawari par baithne ki taqat nahin rakhta. Aap ka kya khayal hai, kya main is ki taraf se hajj kar sakti hun?' Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Han.' Sufyan ne kaha: Main ne use Zuhri se isi tarah yaad kiya."
"928","[AI-translation] Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se Amr bin Dinar ki sanad se isi ki misl riwayat hai. Is riwayat mein yeh izafi kalime hain: Us aurat ne kaha: 'Ya Rasulullah! Kya yeh is ke liye faida degi?' Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Han, jaise agar is par qarz hota aur tum use is ki taraf se ada kar detin to use faida deta, isi tarah hajj bhi is ke liye faida dega.'"
"929","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Fazl bin Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke peeche Aap ki sawari par sawar the. Khats'am qabeela ki ek aurat aai aur fatwa mangne lagi. Fazl use dekhne lage aur woh Fazl ko dekhne lagi. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Fazl ka chehra doosri taraf pher diya. Us aurat ne kaha: 'Ya Rasulullah! Allah ke hajj ka fareeza mere budhe walid tak pahuncha hai jabke woh sawari par baithne ki taqat nahin rakhta. Kya main is ki taraf se hajj karun?' Aap ne farmaya: 'Han.' Aur yeh hajjatul wada' mein tha."
"930","[AI-translation] Fazl bin Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Khats'am qabeela ki ek aurat ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kaha: 'Allah ke hajj ka fareeza mere walid tak pahuncha hai jabke woh bahut budhe hain aur apne oont ki peeth par baithne ki taqat nahin rakhte.' Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Is ki taraf se hajj karo.'"
"931","[AI-translation] Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tamam Mina qurbangah hai.' Phir Khats'am qabeela ki ek aurat Aap ke paas aai aur kaha: 'Mere walid budhe aur kamzor ho gae hain, aur hajj ka fareeza jo Allah ne apne bandon par farz kiya hai in tak pahuncha hai, jabke woh use ada karne ki taqat nahin rakhte. Agar main in ki taraf se use ada karun to kya yeh in ke liye kafi hoga?' Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Han.'"
"932","[AI-translation] Thawus se riwayat hai ke ek aurat Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aai aur kaha: 'Meri walida faut ho gain jabke in par hajj farz tha.' To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Apni walida ki taraf se hajj karo.'"
"933","[AI-translation] Ibn Sirin se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne nazr mani ke jab is ka koi bacha doodh chhudane ki umr tak pahunche, ke woh doodh ko dhoe, khud piye, aur jo is ke sath hon unhen pilaye, to woh use sath le jaega aur khud bhi hajj karega. Us budhe ke bachchon mein se ek ko is ka ilm hua, aur woh aadmi bahut budha ho chuka tha. To is ke bete ne poora muamla Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko bataya. Us ne kaha: 'Beshak mere walid bahut budhe ho gae hain, woh hajj karne ki taqat nahin rakhte. Kya main in ki taraf se hajj kar sakta hun?' Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Han.'"
"934","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Meri walida bahut budhi hain, woh oont par sawar hone ki taqat nahin rakhtin, aur agar main unhen bandh dun to mujhe khadsha hai ke woh faut ho jaengi. Kya main in ki taraf se hajj karun? Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Han.'"
"935","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne un se poocha: 'Main ne ek qaum se ujrat li hai ke main in ke sath hajj karunga. Kya mera hajj durust hoga?' Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne jawab diya: 'Han, yeh woh log hain jin ke liye in ke kiye mein se hissa hai, aur Allah hisab mein jald hai [Baqarah: 202].'"
"936","[AI-translation] Ata se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se poocha: 'Main ne ek qaum se ujrat li hai taake main in ke sath hajj karun. Kya mera hajj durust hoga?' Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha: 'Han, in ke liye in ke a'mal ka hissa hai, aur Allah hisab mein jald hai.'"
"937","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke jab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) wapas aae aur Rauha ke maqam par chand sawaron se mile to Aap ne unhen salam kiya aur poocha: 'Tum kaun log ho?' Unhon ne kaha: 'Ham Musalman hain, aur tum kaun log ho?' Aap ne farmaya: 'Main Rasulullah hun.' Ek aurat ne apne bachche ko kajave se apne hathon mein uthaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya is bachche ke liye hajj hai? Aap ne farmaya: 'Han, aur sawab tumhare liye hai.'"
"938","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) kajave mein ek aurat ke paas se guzre. Us se kaha gaya: 'Yeh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hain.' To us ne apne bachche ka bazu pakda aur kaha: 'Kya is ka hajj durust hai?' Aap ne farmaya: 'Han, aur sawab tumhare liye hai.'"
"939","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) kajave mein ek aurat ke paas se guzre. Us aurat se kaha gaya: 'Yeh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hain.' To us ne apne bachche ka bazu pakda aur kaha: 'Kya is ka hajj durust hai?' Nabi ne farmaya: 'Han, aur sawab tumhare liye hai.'"
"940","[AI-translation] Abu Safar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne farmaya: Aey logon! Suno jo tum kahte ho, aur samjho jo main tum se kahta hun: Agar ghulam ko is ke aaqa hajj karaen aur woh aazad hone se pahle faut ho jae to is ka hajj mukammal hai. Magar agar woh faut hone se pahle aazad ho jae to use hajj karna chahiye. Aur agar bachche ko is ke ghar wale hajj karaen aur woh hajj farz hone se pahle faut ho jae to is ka hajj mukammal hai. Aur agar woh baligh ho jae to use hajj karna chahiye."
"941","[AI-translation] Abu Safar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne farmaya: Aey logon! Suno jo tum kahte ho, aur samjho jo main tum se kahta hun: Agar ghulam ko is ke aaqa hajj karaen aur woh aazad hone se pahle faut ho jae to is ka hajj mukammal hai. Magar agar woh faut hone se pahle aazad ho jae to use dobara hajj karna chahiye. Aur agar bachche ko is ke ghar wale hajj karaen aur woh hajj farz hone se pahle faut ho jae to is ka hajj mukammal hai. Aur agar woh baligh ho jae to use dobara hajj karna chahiye."
"942","[AI-translation] Ibn Tawus aur Amr bin Dinar se riwayat hai ke Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne farmaya: 'Ihsar sirf dushman se hai.' Ibn Tawus aur Amr bin Dinar mein se ek ne yeh izafi kalime bayan kiye: 'Ab woh ihsar bhi khatm ho gaya hai.'"
"943","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: 'Jo beemari ki wajah se ruk jae woh halal na ho yahan tak ke woh Baitullah ka tawaf kare aur Safa aur Marwah ke darmiyan sa'i kare.'"
"944","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: 'Jo Baitullah se beemari ki wajah se ruk jae woh halal na ho yahan tak ke woh Baitullah ka tawaf kare aur Safa aur Marwah ke darmiyan sa'i kare.'"
"945","[AI-translation] Sulaiman bin Yasar se riwayat hai ke Ibn Umar, Marwan aur Ibn Zubair (Raziyallahu anhum) ne Ibn Khuzamah Makhzumi ko fatwa diya jabke woh Makkah ke raste mein sar ke dard mein mubtala the aur ehram mein the. Unhon ne kaha ke woh jitna ho sake ilaj karae, aur unhen fatwa diya ke jab woh sehat ho jae to umrah kare aur halal ho jae. Ab is par wajib hai ke woh aane wale saal hajj kare aur qurbani bhi kare."
"946","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke woh Makkah mein dakhil hone se pahle ghusl karte."
"947","[AI-translation] Ata ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Makkah mein dakhil hue to Aap ne kisi ki taraf tawajjuh na farmayi aur na kisi ki taraf maail hue."
"948","[AI-translation] Ibn Juraij se riwayat hai ke jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Baitullah ko dekhte to apne donon hath uthate aur dua farmate: 'Aey Allah! Is ghar ki izzat, azmat, sharafat aur haibat mein izafa farma. Aur jo log is ki tazeem aur takreem karte hain, jo is ka hajj aur umrah karte hain, in ki izzat, hurmat, azmat aur bhalai mein izafa farma.'"
"949","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Musayyab se riwayat hai ke jab woh Baitullah ko dekhte to yeh dua padhte: 'Aey Allah! Tu salam hai aur Tujh se salam hai. Aey Rab! Hamen salam ke sath zinda rakh.'"
"950","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan kiya ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Hath namaz mein, Ka'bah ko dekhte waqt, Safa aur Marwah par, Arafah ki raat, Muzdalifah mein, donon jamrah ke paas, aur maiyat par uthae jate hain.'"
"951","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Abbad bin Ja'far se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) ko Hajar Aswad ke paas aate dekha jabke in ka sar gard alood tha. Unhon ne use bosa diya, phir is par sajda kiya, phir use bosa diya aur sajda kiya, phir use bosa diya aur sajda kiya."
"952","[AI-translation] Abu Ja'far se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) ko Zulhijjah ki aath tarikh ko aate dekha jabke in ka sar gard se dhaka tha. Unhon ne Hajar Aswad ko bosa diya, phir is par sajda kiya, phir use bosa diya aur sajda kiya, aur aisa teen martaba kiya."
"953","[AI-translation] Ibn Juraij ne bayan kiya ke main ne Ata se poocha: 'Kya tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke Sahaba mein se kisi ko dekha ke woh istilam karte waqt apne hathon ko bosa dete?' Ata ne kaha: 'Han, main ne Jabir bin Abdullah, Ibn Umar, Abu Sa'id Khudri, aur Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhum) ko dekha ke jab woh istilam karte to apne hathon ko bhi bosa dete.' Ibn Juraij ne kaha: 'Aur Ibn Abbas bhi?' Ata ne kaha: 'Han, aur mera khayal hai main ne aur bhi dekhe.' Ibn Juraij ne kaha: 'Kya tum istilam karte waqt apne hathon ko bosa nahin dete?' Unhon ne kaha: 'Han, magar ab main unhen bosa nahin deta.'"
"954","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: 'Jab tum Rukn par bheed pao to wapas laut jao, wahan na khade raho.'"
"955","[AI-translation] Manbuz bin Abi Sulaiman se, apni walida se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki biwi Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ke paas thin jab in ki aazad karda laundi in ke paas aai aur kaha: 'Aey Ummul Momineen! Main ne Baitullah ke saat chakkar lagaae aur do ya teen martaba chhua.' To Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne un se kaha: 'Allah tumhen sawab na de, Allah tumhen sawab na de! Kya tum mardon ko dhakke deti thin? Kya tum takbeer kahte hue guzar nahin sakti thin?'"
"956","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hajj aur umrah mein tawaf karte to pahle teen chakkar mein daudte aur baqi chaar mein paidal chalte. Phir Aap do rak'aten padhte, phir Safa aur Marwah ke darmiyan sa'i karte."
"957","[AI-translation] Ata se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne saat chakkar mein se teen ramal ke sath mukammal kiye, aur in ke darmiyan aam chalna na tha."
"958","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke woh Hajar Aswad se Hajar Aswad tak ramal karte, phir kahte: 'Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) isi tarah karte.'"
"959","[AI-translation] Masruq se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Abdullah bin Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) ko dekha ke unhon ne Hajar Aswad ko chhoo kar aaghaz kiya, phir teen chakkar daen janib tez chal kar tawaf kiya, aur chaar chakkar aam chal kar. Phir woh Maqam Ibrahim (Alaihissalam) ke paas aae aur is ke peeche do rak'aten padhin."
"960","[AI-translation] Ibn Abi Mulaikah se riwayat hai ke Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne tawaf ke liye Hajar Aswad ko chhua, phir kaha: 'Ab ham kiske liye kandhe kholen aur kisko quwwat dikhlaen, jabke Allah ne Islam ko ghalib kar diya hai? Allah ki qasam! Main isi tarah sa'i karunga jaise unhon ne kiya.'"
"961","[AI-translation] Thawus ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ko kahte suna: 'Tawaf mein kam bolo, kyunke tum namaz jaisi ibadat mein ho.'"
"962","[AI-translation] Ata ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Umar aur Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhum) ke peeche tawaf kiya, aur main ne in mein se kisi ko baat karte na suna yahan tak ke unhon ne apna tawaf mukammal kiya."
"963","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Ka'b se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke Sahaba mein se ek Hajar Aswad ke tamam arkan ko chhute aur kahte: 'Baitullah mein se kuch chhodna jaiz nahin.' To Ibn Abbas ne kaha: 'Beshak tumhare liye Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zaat mein behtareen namuna hai [Ahzab: 21].'"
"964","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Ka'b se riwayat hai ke Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) Rukn Yamani aur Hajar Aswad ko chhute, jabke Ibn Zubair (Raziyallahu anhu) tamam arkan ko chhute aur kahte: 'Baitullah mein se kuch chhodna jaiz nahin.' Aur Ibn Abbas kahte: 'Beshak tumhare liye Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mein behtareen namuna hai [Ahzab: 21].'"
"965","[AI-translation] Sa'ib bin Abdullah se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Rukn Yamani aur Hajar Aswad ke darmiyan dua farmate suna: 'Aey hamare Rab! Hamen duniya mein bhalai de aur aakhirat mein bhalai de, aur hamen Jahannam ke azab se bacha [Baqarah: 201].'"
"966","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Hijr Baitullah ka hissa hai. Aur Allah Azza wa Jalla ne farmaya: 'Aur unhen qadeem Baitullah ka tawaf karna chahiye [Hajj: 29].' Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Hijr ke peeche se tawaf kiya."
"967","[AI-translation] Salim bin Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat hai ke Abdullah bin Muhammad bin Abi Bakr ne Abdullah bin Umar ko Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se khabar di: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Kya tum ne nahin dekha ke tumhari qaum ne jab Ka'bah banaya to Ibrahim (Alaihissalam) ki buniyadon ko chhod diya?' To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya Aap use Ibrahim (Alaihissalam) ki buniyadon par wapas nahin karenge? Aap ne farmaya: 'Agar tumhari qaum kufr se nai na hoti to main use is ki asal par wapas kar deta.' To Ibn Umar ne kaha: Agar Aishah ne yeh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna hai to main nahin samajhta ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Hijr se lagne wale do arkan ko chhuna is liye chhoda magar Baitullah Ibrahim (Alaihissalatu wassalam) ki buniyadon par mukammal nahin hua."
"968","[AI-translation] Abu Yazeed se riwayat hai ke Umar ne Banu Zuhrah ke ek buzurg ki taraf ek aadmi bheja. To main bhi is ke sath Umar ke paas aaya jabke woh Hateem mein the. Unhon ne un se zamana jahiliyat ke bachchon ke bare mein poocha. To us buzurg ne kaha: Nutfa ek shakhs ka hota aur bacha doosre ke bistar par paida hota. Umar ne farmaya: Tum ne sach kaha, lekin Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne faisla diya ke bacha bistar wale ka hai. Jab woh buzurg wapas gae to Umar ne unhen bulaya aur poocha: Mujhe Baitullah ki tameer ke bare mein batao? Unhon ne kaha: Quraish ne Ka'bah ki tameer ke liye chanda jama kiya magar use mukammal karne ki taqat na rakhte. To unhon ne is ka baaz hissa Hateem mein chhod diya. Umar ne un se kaha: Tum ne sach kaha."
"969","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah Ansari (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hajjatul wada' mein Baitullah ka tawaf aur Safa aur Marwah ke darmiyan sa'i sawari par kiya taake log Aap ko dekhen aur Aap in se upar hon, kyunke logon ne Aap ko gher rakha tha."
"970","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sawari par Ka'bah ka tawaf kiya, aur Hajar Aswad ko apne asaa se chhua."
"971","[AI-translation] Ek doosri sanad se Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki misl riwayat hai."
"972","[AI-translation] Ata se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Baitullah ka tawaf aur Safa aur Marwah ke darmiyan sa'i sawari par kiya. Ibn Juraij ne kaha: Main ne poocha: 'Kyun?' Ata ne kaha: 'Main nahin janta.' Unhon ne kaha: 'Phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) utre aur do rak'aten padhin.'"
"973","[AI-translation] Ahwas bin Hakeem se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) ko Safa aur Marwah ke darmiyan gadhe par sawar ho kar sa'i karte dekha."
"974","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sawari par Ka'bah ka tawaf kiya, aur Hajar Aswad ko apne asaa se chhua."
"975","[AI-translation] Ata se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se farmaya: 'Tumhara Baitullah ka tawaf aur Safa aur Marwah ke darmiyan sa'i tumhare hajj aur umrah ke liye kafi hai.'"
"976","[AI-translation] Ek doosri sanad se Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki misl riwayat hai."
"977","[AI-translation] Kabhi Sufyan Ibn Abi Najih ke waste ke baghair Ata se riwayat karte, aur woh Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat karte."
"978","[AI-translation] Kabhi yeh kalime kahe gae: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se farmaya."
"979","[AI-translation] Ata se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne chaaron umrah mein Baitullah ka tawaf aur Safa aur Marwah ke darmiyan sa'i kiya, siwae pahle aur chauthe umrah ke ke unhon ne Aap ko Hudaibiyah se wapas kar diya."
"980","[AI-translation] Ata se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ko hajj ke liye bheja to unhon ne sa'i ki. Phir apni khilafat mein Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) bhi aisa karte, phir Umar, phir Usman, aur in donon ke baad aane wale khalifa, in ke baad ke tamam khalifa isi tarah sa'i karte."
"981","[AI-translation] Safiyah bint Shaibah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Banu Abduddar ki Abi Tijarah ki beti naam ki ek aurat ne mujhe khabar di ke main Quraish ki aurton ke sath Abil Husain ke ghar aai. Ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Safa aur Marwah ke darmiyan sa'i karte dekha. Main ne Aap ko sa'i karte dekha aur Aap ka tehband sakht sa'i ki wajah se ghoom raha tha, yahan tak ke main kahti hun ke main ne Aap ke donon ghutne dekhe. Aur main ne Aap ko farmate suna: 'Sa'i karo! Beshak Allah ne tum par sa'i farz ki hai.'"
"982","[AI-translation] Ubaidullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: 'Aurton par na Baitullah ki sa'i hai aur na Safa aur Marwah ki.'"
"983","[AI-translation] Hasan bin Muslim bin Yanaq se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein Tarwiyah ka din, Zulhijjah ki aath, Jumah ko pada. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Ka'bah ke samne khade hue aur logon ko Mina ki taraf rawana hone ka hukm diya. Aur Aap bhi gae aur Zuhar ki namaz Mina mein padhi."
"984","[AI-translation] Salim se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Mina mein do rak'aten padhin. Is ke baad Abu Bakr aur Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne bhi aisa kiya."
"985","[AI-translation] Ek doosri sanad se Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se isi ki misl riwayat hai."
"986","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke jab suraj tulu hota to woh subah Mina se Arafat rawana hote."
"987","[AI-translation] Amr bin Dinar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe us ne khabar di jis ne Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) ko dekha ke woh sahar ke waqt Arafah aate."
"988","[AI-translation] Zazan se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi ne Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se ghusl ke bare mein poocha. To unhon ne jawab diya: Agar tum chaho to har din ghusl karo. Us aadmi ne poocha: Wajib ghusl? Ali ne farmaya: Jumah ke din, Arafah ke din, qurbani ke din, aur Eid Fitr ke din."
"989","[AI-translation] Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se Hajj Islam ke bare mein riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Arafah mein wuqoof ki jagah tashreef lae, logon se pahla khutba kaha, phir Bilal ne azan kahi. To Nabi ne doosra khutba shuru kiya. Jab Aap apne khutbe se farigh hue to Bilal azan se farigh hue. Phir Bilal ne iqamat kahi aur Zuhar ki namaz padhi gai, phir Bilal ne iqamat kahi aur Asar ki namaz padhi gai."
"990","[AI-translation] Ek doosri sanad se Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se isi ki misl riwayat hai. Shafi'i ne farmaya: Meri jo rae hai woh yeh hai: Arafah mein ek azan aur do iqamaten hain."
"991","[AI-translation] Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se ek doosri sanad se isi ki misl riwayat hai."
"992","[AI-translation] Amr bin Abdullah bin Safwan se, apne mamun se, agar Allah chahe jise Yazeed bin Shaiban kaha jata hai, se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Arafah mein apne wuqoof ki jagah the jise Amr ne imam ke wuqoof ki jagah se bahut door rakha tha. Phir Ibn Mirba' Ansari (Raziyallahu anhu) hamare paas aae aur ham se kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka tumhare paas qasid hun. Aap tumhen hukm dete hain ke apne in masha'ir par wuqoof karo, kyunke tum apne baap Ibrahim (Alaihissalam) ki wirasat par ho."
"993","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: 'Jo hajiyon mein se qurbani ki raat pa le aur tulu' fajr se pahle Arafah ke pahadon par wuqoof kare to us ne hajj pa liya. Aur jo Arafah na pa sake aur tulu' fajr se pahle wahan wuqoof na kare to is ka hajj chhoot gaya. To woh Baitullah aae aur is ka saat chakkar tawaf kare, aur Safa aur Marwah ke darmiyan saat chakkar sa'i kare. Phir chahe to sar mundae ya baal katwae. Aur agar is ke paas hadi ho to mundwane se pahle use zibah kare. Phir jab woh tawaf aur sa'i se farigh ho jae to sar mundae ya katwae. Phir apne ghar walon ki taraf wapas jae. Phir agar aane wale saal hajj pae to hajj kare agar taqat rakhta ho aur qurbani bhi kare. Aur agar hadi na pae to is ke badle mein hajj mein teen din ke roze rakhe aur saat din jab apne ghar walon ki taraf wapas jae.'"
"994","[AI-translation] Sulaiman bin Yasar se riwayat hai ke Abu Ayyub hajj ke liye nikle yahan tak ke jab Makkah ke raste mein Badiyah ke maqam par pahunche to in ki oontniyan gum ho gain. Woh qurbani ke din Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas aae aur un se is ka zikr kiya. To unhon ne un se kaha: 'Waisa karo jaisa umrah karne wala karta hai, phir tum halal ho gae. Phir jab aane wale saal hajj pao to hajj karo aur jo hadi aasan ho qurbani karo.'"
"995","[AI-translation] Sulaiman bin Yasar se riwayat hai ke Habbar bin Aswad aae jabke Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ek jawan oontni zibah kar rahe the."
"996","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Qais bin Makhramah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne khutba diya aur farmaya: 'Zamana jahiliyat ke log Arafah se suraj ghurub hone se pahle aur Muzdalifah se suraj tulu' hone ke baad rawana hote yahan tak ke suraj goya logon ke chehron par amame hota. Aur ham Arafah se suraj ghurub hone tak rawana nahin hote aur Muzdalifah se suraj tulu' hone se pahle rawana hote hain. Hamara tareeqa but paraston aur shirk walon ke tareeqe ke khilaf hai.'"
"997","[AI-translation] Ibn Tawus se, apne walid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Zamana jahiliyat ke log Arafah se suraj ghurub hone se pahle aur Muzdalifah se suraj tulu' hone ke baad rawana hote. Aur woh kahte: 'Aey Subair! Roshan ho taake ham wapas jaen.' To Allah ne ise mo'akhkhar kiya aur use muqaddam kiya."
"998","[AI-translation] Ibn Tawus se, apne walid se riwayat hai."
"999","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Qais bin Makhramah se riwayat hai, in donon mein se ek ne doosre par izafa kiya aur donon ma'na mein jama hue, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Zamana jahiliyat ke log Arafah se suraj ghurub hone se pahle aur Muzdalifah se suraj tulu' hone ke baad rawana hote. Aur woh kahte: Aey Subair! Chamak taake ham wapas jaen. To Allah ne ise mo'akhkhar kiya aur use muqaddam kiya, yani Muzdalifah ko suraj tulu' hone se pahle muqaddam kiya, aur Arafah ko suraj ghurub hone tak mo'akhkhar kiya.'"
"1000","[AI-translation] Salim se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Muzdalifah mein Maghrib aur Isha ki namaz jama karke padhi."
"1001","[AI-translation] Ubaidullah bin Abi Yazeed se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Abbas ko kahte suna: Main un mein se tha jinhen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne kamzor ghar walon mein se Muzdalifah se Mina pahle bhej diya."
"1002","[AI-translation] Hisham bin Urwah se, apne walid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) qurbani ke din Umm Salamah ke paas aae aur unhen hukm diya ke woh Jam' se ifadah mein jaldi karen yahan tak ke Makkah aaen aur wahan Fajr ki namaz padhen. Aur woh in ka din tha aur Aap chahte the ke woh Aap se milen."
"1003","[AI-translation] Zainab bint Abi Salamah se, Umm Salamah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki misl riwayat hai."
"1004","[AI-translation] Amrah se riwayat hai ke unhon ne unhen khabar di ke Aishah jab in ke sath aurten hajj kartin jo haiz se darti thin to unhen qurbani ke din aage bhej deti thin aur woh ifadah karti thin. Aur agar is ke baad unhen haiz aata to woh in ke paak hone ka intezar na kartin balke inhen lekar rawana ho jatin jabke woh haiz ki haalat mein hoti thin."
"1005","[AI-translation] Qasim bin Muhammad se riwayat hai ke Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) aurton ko haiz ke khauf se ifadah mein jaldi karne ka hukm deti thin."
"1006","[AI-translation] Ibn Tawus se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne Sahaba ko ifadah mein jaldi karne ka hukm diya. Aur Aap ne apni biwiyon ke sath raat mein apni sawari par ifadah kiya jabke Aap apne asaa se Rukn ko chhute, mera khayal hai unhon ne kaha: Aur asaa ke sire ko bosa dete."
"1007","[AI-translation] Ibn Tawus se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne Sahaba ko ifadah mein jaldi karne ka hukm diya. Aur Aap ne apni biwiyon ke sath raat mein ifadah kiya aur Baitullah ka tawaf kiya jabke Aap apne asaa se Hajar ko chhute, mera khayal hai unhon ne kaha: Aur asaa ke sire ko bosa dete."
"1008","[AI-translation] Ibn Tawus se, apne walid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Muzdalifah se rawana hue aur Aap ki oontni ne apna rakha hua paon na uthaya yahan tak ke jamrah par kankariyan marin."
"1009","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Abdur Rahman bin Yarbu' se, Jubair bin Huwairis se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ko Quzah par khade dekha jabke woh kahte: Aey logon! Roshan karo. Phir woh rawana hue aur goya main in ki raan ko dekh raha hun ke woh apne oont ko apne asaa se maar rahe the."
"1010","[AI-translation] Abu Zubair se, Jabir se riwayat hai."
"1011","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Abdur Rahman bin Yarbu' se, Abul Huwairis se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Bakr Siddiq (Raziyallahu anhu) ko Quzah par khade dekha jabke woh kahte: Aey logon! Subah karo. Phir woh rawana hue aur main ne in ki raan dekhi ke woh apne oont ko apne asaa se maar rahe the."
"1012","[AI-translation] Hisham bin Urwah se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) Muhassir ki wadi mein tez chalte aur yeh she'r padhte: 'Teri taraf subah rawana hai bechain jabke is ka kajawe ka kapda Nasara ke deen ke khilaf is ka deen hai.'"
"1013","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Ibrahim bin Haris Taimi se, apni qaum Banu Taim ke ek aadmi se jise Mu'az ya Ibn Mu'az kaha jata hai, se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Mina mein logon ko in ki jaghon par thahrate aur farmate: 'Khadzaf ki kankariyon jaisi kankariyan maro.'"
"1014","[AI-translation] Abu Zubair se, Jabir se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko jamrah par khadzaf ki kankariyon jaisi kankariyan marte dekha."
"1015","[AI-translation] Amr bin Dinar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe hajjam ne khabar di ke us ne Ibn Abbas ke baal katwae to unhon ne kaha: Daen janib se aaghaz karo."
"1016","[AI-translation] Abu Ali Azdi se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Umar ko hajjam se kahte suna: Aey ladke! Haddi tak pahuncha. Aur jab baal katwae to daen janib se pahle le baen janib se pahle nahin."
"1017","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke jab woh hajj ya umrah mein sar mundwate to apni dadhi aur moonchh mein se bhi kuch katwate."
"1018","[AI-translation] Isa bin Talhah bin Ubaidullah se, Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hajjatul wada' mein Mina mein logon ke liye khade hue jabke woh Aap se sawal karte the. Phir ek aadmi Aap ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mujhe maloom na tha aur main ne zibah karne se pahle sar munda liya. Aap ne farmaya: 'Zibah karo aur koi harj nahin.' Phir ek doosra aadmi Aap ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mujhe maloom na tha aur main ne ghabra kar kankariyan marne se pahle qurbani kar di. Aap ne farmaya: 'Kankariyan maro aur koi harj nahin.' Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se aage ya peeche karne ke bare mein jo poocha gaya to Aap ne farmaya: 'Karo aur koi harj nahin.'"
"1019","[AI-translation] Salim bin Abdullah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum jamrah par kankariyan mar lo to tumhare liye woh halal ho gaya jo tum par haram tha siwae aurton aur khushbu ke.'"
"1020","[AI-translation] Salim bin Abdullah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne farmaya: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko khushbu lagai. Imla ki kitab mein kaha: Aap ke halal hone aur Aap ke ehram ke liye. Salim ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki sunnat zyada haqdar hai ke is ki pairwi ki jae."
"1021","[AI-translation] Qasim bin Muhammad aur Urwah se riwayat hai, woh donon Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se khabar dete hain ke unhon ne kaha: 'Main ne apne donon hathon se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko hajjatul wada' mein Aap ke halal hone aur ehram ke liye khushbu lagai.'"
"1022","[AI-translation] Salim bin Abdullah se, Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Baitullah ki ziyarat se pahle aur jamrah ke baad khushbu se mana farmaya. Salim ne kaha: To Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne farmaya: Main ne apne hath se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Aap ke ehram ke liye is se pahle ke Aap ehram bandhen khushbu lagai aur Aap ke halal hone ke liye Baitullah ke tawaf se pahle khushbu lagai. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki sunnat zyada haqdar hai."
"1023","[AI-translation] Salim bin Abdullah se riwayat hai, kabhi woh kahte: Apne walid se, aur kabhi use na kahte, unhon ne kaha: Umar ne kaha: Jab tum jamrah par kankariyan mar lo, zibah kar lo, aur sar munda lo to tumhare liye sab halal ho gaya jo tum par haram tha siwae aurton aur khushbu ke. Salim ne kaha: Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne farmaya: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Aap ke ehram ke liye is se pahle ke Aap ehram bandhen khushbu lagai aur Aap ke halal hone ke liye jamrah par kankariyan marne ke baad aur ziyarat se pahle khushbu lagai. Salim ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki sunnat zyada haqdar hai ke is ki pairwi ki jae."
"1024","[AI-translation] Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne ghar walon mein se pani pilane walon ko Mina ki raaton mein Makkah mein raat guzarne ki rukhsat di."
"1025","[AI-translation] Ata se isi ki misl riwayat hai. Ata ne izafa kiya: In ke pani pilane ki wajah se."
"1026","[AI-translation] Amr bin Sulaim Zurqi se, apni walida se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab ham Mina mein the to Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) oont par sawar ho kar kahte: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Beshak yeh din khane aur peene ke din hain, tum mein se koi roza na rakhe.' Log in ke peeche chale jabke woh apne oont par sawar the, in mein is ka buland awaz se elaan karte."
"1027","[AI-translation] Urwah se, Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se hajj tamattu' karne wale ke bare mein riwayat hai ke jab woh hadi na pae aur Arafah se pahle roze na rakhe to woh Mina ke dinon mein roze rakhe."
"1028","[AI-translation] Salim se, apne walid se isi ki misl riwayat hai."
"1029","[AI-translation] Thawus se, Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Log har taraf se wapas jate. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Hajiyon mein se koi na jae yahan tak ke is ka aakhri ahad Baitullah mein ho.'"
"1030","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se, Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: 'Hajiyon mein se koi wapas na jae yahan tak ke is ka aakhri ahad Baitullah mein ho. Beshak manasik ka aakhir Baitullah ka tawaf hai.'"
"1031","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: 'Hajiyon mein se koi wapas na jae yahan tak ke woh Baitullah ka tawaf kare. Kyunke manasik ka aakhir Baitullah ka tawaf hai.' Malik ne kaha: Yeh hamare khayal mein, Wallahu a'lam, Allah ke farman ki wajah se hai: Phir is ka halal hona qadeem Baitullah tak hai [Hajj: 33], sha'air ka halal hona aur is ka ikhtitam qadeem Baitullah hai."
"1032","[AI-translation] Sulaiman Ahwal jo Sulaiman bin Abi Muslim Ibn Abi Najih ke mamun hain aur siqah hain, se, Thawus se, Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Log har taraf se wapas jate. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tum mein se koi wapas na jae yahan tak ke is ka aakhri ahad Baitullah mein ho.'"
"1033","[AI-translation] Ibn Tawus se, apne walid se, Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Logon ko hukm diya gaya ke in ka aakhri ahad Baitullah mein ho, siwae is ke ke Aap ne haiz wali aurat ko rukhsat di."
"1034","[AI-translation] Hasan bin Muslim se, Thawus se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Ibn Abbas ke paas tha jab Zaid bin Sabit ne un se kaha: 'Kya tum fatwa dete ho ke haiz wali aurat Baitullah mein apne aakhri ahad se pahle wapas jae?' Unhon ne kaha: 'Han.' Unhon ne kaha: 'Aisa fatwa na do.' To Ibn Abbas ne kaha: 'Warna falan Ansari aurat se poocho, kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use is ka hukm diya tha?' Unhon ne kaha: To Zaid bin Sabit hanste hue wapas aae aur kaha: 'Main tumhen sachche ke siwa nahin samajhta.'"
"1035","[AI-translation] Amr bin Dinar aur Ibrahim bin Maisarah se, Thawus se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Ibn Umar ke paas baitha aur unhen kahte suna: 'Tum mein se koi na jae yahan tak ke is ka aakhri ahad Baitullah mein ho.' To main ne kaha: Use kya hai? Kya us ne nahin suna jo is ke Sahaba ne suna? Phir main aane wale saal in ke paas baitha aur unhen kahte suna: 'Woh samajhte hain ke Aap ne haiz wali aurat ko rukhsat di.'"
"1036","[AI-translation] Thawus se, Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Logon ko hukm diya gaya ke in ka aakhri ahad Baitullah mein ho, siwae is ke ke Aap ne haiz wali aurat ko rukhsat di."
"1037","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Qasim se, apne walid se, Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Safiyah ko ifadah ke baad haiz aaya. To main ne is ke haiz ka zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kiya. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Kya woh hamen rokne wali hai?' To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Use ifadah ke baad haiz aaya hai. Aap ne farmaya: 'To phir koi harj nahin.' Malik ne Abdur Rahman bin Qasim se isi ki misl riwayat kiya."
"1038","[AI-translation] Zuhri se, Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Safiyah ko qurbani ke din haiz aaya. To Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne is ke haiz ka zikr Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kiya. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Woh hamen rokne wali hai.' To main ne kaha: Us ne ifadah kar liya tha phir is ke baad haiz aaya. Aap ne farmaya: 'To phir rawana ho jao.'"
"1039","[AI-translation] Hisham bin Urwah se, apne walid se, Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Safiyah bint Huyay ka zikr kiya. To kaha gaya: Use haiz aaya hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Shayad woh hamen rokne wali hai.' Kaha gaya: Us ne ifadah kar liya hai. Aap ne farmaya: 'To phir koi harj nahin.'"
"1040","[AI-translation] Malik ne kaha: Hisham ne kaha: Urwah ne kaha: Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne farmaya: Ham is ka zikr karte hain to log apni aurton ko aage kyun bhejte hain agar in ke liye faida na ho? Agar woh hota jo tum kahte ho to Mina mein chhe hazaar se zyada haiz wali aurten hoti thin."
